<title>USA: Tellabs system picked by Pakistan company.</title>
<headline>Tellabs system picked by Pakistan company.</headline>
<dateline>LISLE, Ill. 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tellabs Inc said Thursday it will supply its Martis DXX managed access and transport network system to  Pakistan Telecommunications Co Ltd for use in a business services network encompassing that country.</p>
<p>Tellabs said it won the contract in association with its distribution partner,  Multi-Tech Systems Ltd.</p>
<p>It said the telecommunications system will provide a managed transport network for all business services provided by Pakistan Telecommunications.</p>
<p>The value of the agreement was not disclosed.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
